{"v":4,"catch":"在美國成功引進日本，QIX終於加入Arcade Archives！","desc":"《QIX》是TAITO AMERICA（美國分公司）於1981年開發並引進日本的一款線描益智遊戲。\n玩家控制\"Marker\"來畫線，封閉和控制區域。\n避開在舞台上游蕩的敵對“QIX”和“Sparx”，努力控制至少75%的舞台！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-03-10","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c2b9adc8e813e5081b709c07a9df1214388ebcc3529d27dba5940129163f2a32.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/38d47afb0bcd7d25b2b76b51ff1cc0d75fa3274ea14bed797d94833ba8ec8ec5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0ab5c311df3a119de5e88971103ec1fc68e4e8d606abd762039a3272d9021ffc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6ea4b2d25f281be036c3e21b6d17c5af0402ff22eaeaffc9944b5524cfbd91db.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/658ac18224c60061b9e64f84db641f00debd12b4d583a4b4623108005763a350.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d92c075ce0bb738f85ec1365acd19945d38b72094062a2ed8a13a8a0a24261e1.jpg"],"titleId":"0100778016d8c000","dlc":[]}